<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Nov 25.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Nov 25.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1515 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to Avon range Nov 117.00</p>
<p>London Dec 117.50</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Tilbury Nov 98.50 Dec 98.50 Jan/Mar 100.50</p>
<p>Leicester Dec 95.00</p>
<p>West Country Dec 97.00</p>
<p>Shropshire/Cheshire Jan/Mar 100.00</p>
<p>East Anglia Jan/Mar 100.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to Norfolk Dec 97.00 Jan/Mar 99.00</p>
<p>Leicester Jan/Mar 97.00</p>
<p>Norfolk/Suffolk Dec 97.50</p>
</text>
